'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth VII''' is an [[NPC]] on {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. They give the player a {{Skill|Foraging}}-related quest outside the Rift in exchange for {{Item|Eleanor's Trousers}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth VII''' gives the player a [[Foraging]] quest that they must complete outside the Rift.

Behind the nearby mirror, a replica of the player is equipped with no armor and a {{Lv|1}} {{Item|Ocelot Pet|rarity=leg}} while mining {{Item|Jungle Wood}} with a {{Item|Treecapitator}} on the {{Zone|Jungle Island}}.

To complete the quest, all of the following conditions must be met at the same time:
*Wearing a full Armor set of {{Item|Golden Armor}}, {{Item|Gold Hunter Armor}}, {{Item|Armor of Divan}} or {{Item|Diver's Armor}}
*Equipping a {{Item|Ocelot Pet|rarity=leg}}
*Mining the logs within the coordinates {{coords|-463|127|-83}} and {{coords|-472|127|-83}} inside the {{zone|Jungle Island}}

Once completed, the message "''{{Mctxt|f|You sense a watchful presence...}}''" will appear in chat. The player can then return to '''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth VII''' to claim {{Item|Eleanor's Trousers}}.

